  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing SlideStats Component**\n\nI\'m currently focused on developing the `/src/components/SlideStats.tsx` component. This will be the foundation for Slide 3, which is all about patient statistics spanning 2023-2025 and will include a bar chart and accompanying stats. The title for this slide is \"Metrics from Siloam\". My goal is to structure this component to effectively present that data.\n\n\n**Analyzing Data Representation**\n\nNow, I\'m thinking about the most effective ways to present the patient data. Initially, I\'ll incorporate dynamic counter widgets for quick reference to annual metrics. Furthermore, I\'ll build a Recharts Bar Chart to visualize the trends across the three years, following the color scheme and exact design specifications from Slide 3. I\'m focusing on making sure the data reflects the dynamic state so that any changes are reflected.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 16
      nanos: 18188620
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
