leted the final slides covering the remaining medical specialties, making sure each is correctly indexed. My current slide count is 40; the next step is determining the slide count for the final slides.\n\n\n**Defining Slide Transitions**\n\nI\'ve completed defining the final slides! Specifically, slides 41-44 are set, and the deck now mirrors the PowerPoint precisely with 45 slides. I am now focused on defining client-side data loading, I\'ll be using `fetch(\"/api/data\")` to load the database at boot, with `defaultDatabaseState` as a fallback. I\'ll also add high-fidelity keyboard navigation controls, ensuring seamless user interaction.\n\n\n"
